    "created_at": "2025-05-09T20:15:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-09T20:24:46Z",
    "body": "> It's difficult to go from inline stylesheets to external stylesheets - the syntax goes from this\n> \n> ```\n> <style>foo</style>\n> ```\n> \n> to this\n> \n> ```\n> <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/styles.css\" />\n> ```\n> \n> which is hard to remember.\n> \n> ...  ...\n> \n> ### What solutions exist today?\n\n\n**` <style> @import \"styles.css\"; </style>`**",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
